# Routing control-plane contract graph

Companion to [ROUTING-CONTROL-PLANE-RECONCILIATION.md](ROUTING-CONTROL-PLANE-RECONCILIATION.md). Derived from current contracts and implementation pointers; this graph is a navigation aid, not an execution specification.

